{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28476","headline":"寄宣州郑谏议 · 杜牧","name":"寄宣州郑谏议","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大夫官重醉江东，潇洒名儒振古风。\n文石陛前辞圣主，碧云天外作冥鸿。\n五言宁谢颜光禄，百岁须齐卫武公。\n再拜宜同丈人行，过庭交分有无同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}